<section id="investigation" class="investigation-section" aria-labelledby="investigation-title">
  <div class="shell">
    <header class="section-heading section-heading-inverse reveal-item">
      <p class="eyebrow">Evidence model</p>
      <h2 id="investigation-title">A conclusion is only as useful as its receipts.</h2>
      <p>Findings retain source, confidence, supporting evidence, contradictions, and the run that produced them.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="investigation-shell reveal-item">
      <div class="investigation-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Investigation record views">
        <button id="tab-brief" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="panel-brief" tabindex="0"><span>01</span>Evidence</button>
        <button id="tab-trace" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="panel-trace" tabindex="-1"><span>02</span>Provenance</button>
        <button id="tab-failure" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="panel-failure" tabindex="-1"><span>03</span>Failure semantics</button>
      </div>
      <div id="panel-brief" class="investigation-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-brief" tabindex="0">
        <div class="panel-intro"><div><p class="panel-kicker">Representative evidence set</p><h3>Typed claims keep certainty visible.</h3></div><span class="demo-label">Demo data</span></div>
        <div class="finding-grid">
          <article><span class="evidence-badge fact">Fact</span><p>Active connections reached the configured maximum.</p><small>prometheus:db_connections_active</small></article>
          <article><span class="evidence-badge likely">Likely cause</span><p>Pool exhaustion likely caused checkout request failures.</p><small>supports: evidence_01, evidence_02</small></article>
          <article><span class="evidence-badge hypothesis">Hypothesis</span><p>A recent configuration change may have reduced pool headroom.</p><small>unverified</small></article>
          <article><span class="evidence-badge unknown">Unknown</span><p>No deployment adapter is configured, so change correlation cannot be asserted.</p><small>deployment_adapter_not_configured</small></article>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div id="panel-trace" class="investigation-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-trace" tabindex="0" hidden>
        <div class="panel-intro"><div><p class="panel-kicker">Reproducible by design</p><h3>Every result traces to its execution context.</h3></div></div>
        <dl class="provenance-list"><div><dt>Run</dt><dd>irun_example</dd></div><div><dt>Model</dt><dd>provider + model recorded</dd></div><div><dt>Contracts</dt><dd>prompt + tool versions linked</dd></div><div><dt>Tools</dt><dd>bounded arguments, summaries, hashes</dd></div></dl>
      </div>
      <div id="panel-failure" class="investigation-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-failure" tabindex="0" hidden>
        <div class="panel-intro"><div><p class="panel-kicker">Honest under failure</p><h3>Partial evidence never masquerades as a complete answer.</h3></div></div>
        <ul class="failure-list"><li><b>Unavailable adapter</b><span>Return unavailable; never substitute a mock response.</span></li><li><b>Insufficient evidence</b><span>Persist an explicit unknown outcome.</span></li><li><b>Persistence failure</b><span>Roll back the complete evidence set.</span></li><li><b>Retry</b><span>Reuse the stable run; do not duplicate evidence.</span></li></ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
